/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Over the past 8 years, we have diligently addressed the education crisis in India by strengthening the government-school system through our education interventions. Our areas of operation are densely populated with a tribal demographic, where access to education is limited, and the quality of education provided to tribal children is often inadequate. To address these issues, we have prioritized improving school governance, introducing new pedagogic practices, and empowering teachers and local communities. The primary focus is to enhance the quality of education and ensure equitable access for all children, regardless of their socio-economic background.)
/E (Over the past 8 years, we have diligently addressed the education crisis in India by strengthening the government-school system through our education interventions. Our areas of operation are densely populated with a tribal demographic, where access to education is limited, and the quality of education provided to tribal children is often inadequate. To address these issues, we have prioritized improving school governance, introducing new pedagogic practices, and empowering teachers and local communities. The primary focus is to enhance the quality of education and ensure equitable access for all children, regardless of their socio-economic background.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
