/T (Our Education Model is specifically designed to provide universal access to quality education in remote and hard-to-reach areas and ensure the successful completion of secondary education for all children. We work closely with communities to identify and address cultural norms and practices that perpetuate gender inequality and prejudices. Through our interventions, we strive to increase girls' enrolment and completion rates.)
/E (Our Education Model is specifically designed to provide universal access to quality education in remote and hard-to-reach areas and ensure the successful completion of secondary education for all children. We work closely with communities to identify and address cultural norms and practices that perpetuate gender inequality and prejudices. Through our interventions, we strive to increase girls' enrolment and completion rates.)
