/T (In the financial year 2022-23, ASPIRE has achieved remarkable progress by expanding its reach to various gram panchayats and urban wards across seven districts in five states in India: Odisha, Jharkhand, West Bengal, Chhattisgarh, and Delhi. As a result, access to education has improved for a significant number of children from diverse backgrounds, positively transforming their lives. The program's extensive coverage of government schools and Anganwadi centers in these areas has further created a substantial impact on education in these underserved regions.)
