/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The Education Model is based on a three-pillar approach that is informed by our decades of experience in education policy reform in India. We implement a range of interventions across three verticals - access, learning, and governance.)
/E (The Education Model is based on a three-pillar approach that is informed by our decades of experience in education policy reform in India. We implement a range of interventions across three verticals - access, learning, and governance.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
518 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The ACCESS vertical is designed to ensure that every child has access to quality education. We identify out-of-school children through household surveys and link them to education through bridge courses and enrollment drives. We facilitate the creation of Child Rights Protection Forums \(CRPFs\) to help identify and bring out-of-school children back to school. To ensure regular school attendance, weekly headcounts of children are conducted and follow-up is done with SMC and CRPF members. We support all children in transitioning from primary to upper primary to secondary and maintain Village Education Registers \(VERs\) to track attendance and transition.)
/E (The ACCESS vertical is designed to ensure that every child has access to quality education. We identify out-of-school children through household surveys and link them to education through bridge courses and enrollment drives. We facilitate the creation of Child Rights Protection Forums \(CRPFs\) to help identify and bring out-of-school children back to school. To ensure regular school attendance, weekly headcounts of children are conducted and follow-up is done with SMC and CRPF members. We support all children in transitioning from primary to upper primary to secondary and maintain Village Education Registers \(VERs\) to track attendance and transition.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
519 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The LEARNING vertical focuses on addressing the basic learning deficit of children. We achieve this through our Learning Enrichment Program \(LEP\), demonstrating LEP pedagogy and classroom transactions in select public schools. The aim is to embed LEP pedagogy in public schools, starting from early grades, to eliminate the root causes of the deficit. We promote the use of digital technology to enhance classroom transactions and integrate local culture and knowledge into teaching methods and content. We develop learning habits and enhance the learning experience by setting up school libraries, undertaking pedagogic interventions at early-childhood centers, and incorporating innovations and best practices in teaching methods and content from across the world.)
/E (The LEARNING vertical focuses on addressing the basic learning deficit of children. We achieve this through our Learning Enrichment Program \(LEP\), demonstrating LEP pedagogy and classroom transactions in select public schools. The aim is to embed LEP pedagogy in public schools, starting from early grades, to eliminate the root causes of the deficit. We promote the use of digital technology to enhance classroom transactions and integrate local culture and knowledge into teaching methods and content. We develop learning habits and enhance the learning experience by setting up school libraries, undertaking pedagogic interventions at early-childhood centers, and incorporating innovations and best practices in teaching methods and content from across the world.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
