/T (The GOVERNANCE vertical aims to build community ownership of the education agenda. We strengthen SMCs, PTAs, and anganwadi committees by training them in the management and governance of schools and pre-schools.  We train and orient panchayats in their roles and responsibilities towards school management, the Right to Education framework, and child rights to enhance school performance and increase budgetary spending on education. Furthermore, we orient and train self-help groups and youth groups in child rights to raise awareness levels in the community. )
/E (The GOVERNANCE vertical aims to build community ownership of the education agenda. We strengthen SMCs, PTAs, and anganwadi committees by training them in the management and governance of schools and pre-schools.  We train and orient panchayats in their roles and responsibilities towards school management, the Right to Education framework, and child rights to enhance school performance and increase budgetary spending on education. Furthermore, we orient and train self-help groups and youth groups in child rights to raise awareness levels in the community. )
