/T (In partnership with Tata Steel Foundation \(TSF\), ESP was launched in six blocks across three districts in Odisha, targeting educationally backward areas affected by mining. During the initial phase, significant effort was dedicated to mobilizing the community, engaging local stakeholders, and providing them with a comprehensive understanding of the project's objectives. We assessed the challenges faced by the community and their awareness of education rights. Our interventions included promoting school enrollment, facilitating the return of out-of-school children, and implementing bridging centers and learning enrichment programs.)
/E (In partnership with Tata Steel Foundation \(TSF\), ESP was launched in six blocks across three districts in Odisha, targeting educationally backward areas affected by mining. During the initial phase, significant effort was dedicated to mobilizing the community, engaging local stakeholders, and providing them with a comprehensive understanding of the project's objectives. We assessed the challenges faced by the community and their awareness of education rights. Our interventions included promoting school enrollment, facilitating the return of out-of-school children, and implementing bridging centers and learning enrichment programs.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
