/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (In 2016, we successfully replicated the Education Model in two blocks of Jharkhand's West Singhbhum district, with initial support from The Hans Foundation and TSF for three years, and subsequent funding solely from TSF. Similarly, in September 2020, we expanded to West Bengal's Kharagpur 1 block, covering Arjuni, Kalaikunda, Borkola, and Hariatara anchals. In November 2022, we extended our education approach to the Pondiuproda block in Chhattisgarh's Korba district, an aspirational district.)
/E (In 2016, we successfully replicated the Education Model in two blocks of Jharkhand's West Singhbhum district, with initial support from The Hans Foundation and TSF for three years, and subsequent funding solely from TSF. Similarly, in September 2020, we expanded to West Bengal's Kharagpur 1 block, covering Arjuni, Kalaikunda, Borkola, and Hariatara anchals. In November 2022, we extended our education approach to the Pondiuproda block in Chhattisgarh's Korba district, an aspirational district.)
