/T (The replication involved adapting and applying the proven strategies, approaches, and practices that have shown positive results in the original model to the new setting. This included considering the new states' specific needs, challenges, and context while maintaining the core principles and goals of the education model. We conducted assessments and feasibility studies in Jharkhand, West Bengal, and Chattisgarh and engaged with local stakeholders and communities to understand the context and ensure the successful implementation of the model.)
/E (The replication involved adapting and applying the proven strategies, approaches, and practices that have shown positive results in the original model to the new setting. This included considering the new states' specific needs, challenges, and context while maintaining the core principles and goals of the education model. We conducted assessments and feasibility studies in Jharkhand, West Bengal, and Chattisgarh and engaged with local stakeholders and communities to understand the context and ensure the successful implementation of the model.)
