/T (Scaling up became our focus as the Education Model continued to grow in impact. In October 2019, the program encompassed the entire Keonjhar district, reaching 11 new blocks, highlighting the success of the initial Odisha blocks. The program's success led to further enlargement in December 2021, covering all 18 blocks in West Singhbhum district, and reaching more children in need of quality education. Subsequent expansions included the Hindol block in the Dhenkanal district in 2021 and the Odapada block in November 2022, funded by TSF. With support from The Hans Foundation, we expanded to the Korba District of Chattisgarh in December 2022.)
/E (Scaling up became our focus as the Education Model continued to grow in impact. In October 2019, the program encompassed the entire Keonjhar district, reaching 11 new blocks, highlighting the success of the initial Odisha blocks. The program's success led to further enlargement in December 2021, covering all 18 blocks in West Singhbhum district, and reaching more children in need of quality education. Subsequent expansions included the Hindol block in the Dhenkanal district in 2021 and the Odapada block in November 2022, funded by TSF. With support from The Hans Foundation, we expanded to the Korba District of Chattisgarh in December 2022.)
