568 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The comprehensive set of ACCESS interventions aims to establish child labour free zones, ensuring that all children between the ages of 6 and 14 are enrolled in schools, government hostels, and RBC/NRBC centers, and maintain an average school attendance of around 85% over the last three months. Once the data is verified, the community convenes for a meeting where they officially declare the habitation/panchayat/block as a Child Labour Free Zone. This declaration signifies the community's commitment to continuously monitor and track children's attendance, thus sustaining the CLFZ status.)
/E (The comprehensive set of ACCESS interventions aims to establish child labour free zones, ensuring that all children between the ages of 6 and 14 are enrolled in schools, government hostels, and RBC/NRBC centers, and maintain an average school attendance of around 85% over the last three months. Once the data is verified, the community convenes for a meeting where they officially declare the habitation/panchayat/block as a Child Labour Free Zone. This declaration signifies the community's commitment to continuously monitor and track children's attendance, thus sustaining the CLFZ status.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
569 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (According to the data presented in Table 05, the Phase I and II blocks have successfully achieved CLFZ status, while the ongoing efforts in Phase III's eleven blocks in Keonjhar district and Phase IV's Hindol block are progressing towards becoming CLFZs in the upcoming fall of 2023. These developments highlight the significant strides made in eliminating child labour and ensuring access to education in these areas.)
/E (According to the data presented in Table 05, the Phase I and II blocks have successfully achieved CLFZ status, while the ongoing efforts in Phase III's eleven blocks in Keonjhar district and Phase IV's Hindol block are progressing towards becoming CLFZs in the upcoming fall of 2023. These developments highlight the significant strides made in eliminating child labour and ensuring access to education in these areas.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
