<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The LEARNING vertical is dedicated to ensuring grade-appropriate learning for students by implementing various pedagogic interventions. These initiatives aim to enhance learning outcomes, bridge foundational gaps, and improve teaching methodologies. )
/E (The LEARNING vertical is dedicated to ensuring grade-appropriate learning for students by implementing various pedagogic interventions. These initiatives aim to enhance learning outcomes, bridge foundational gaps, and improve teaching methodologies. )
