626 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The Lockdown Learning initiative was launched in March 2020 as a response to the pandemic, initially targeting 30,000 children who were already enrolled in our LEP. However, in January 2021, after nine months of school closures, we expanded the program to include non-LEP children as well. This expansion brought in approximately 100,000 primary \(grades 3 to 5\) and upper primary \(grades 6 to 8\) students, forming what we called the Lockdown Learning Expansion \(LLX\). Throughout the 2022-23 academic year, our teaching staff provided support to these children at 857 centers, both before and after school. )
/E (The Lockdown Learning initiative was launched in March 2020 as a response to the pandemic, initially targeting 30,000 children who were already enrolled in our LEP. However, in January 2021, after nine months of school closures, we expanded the program to include non-LEP children as well. This expansion brought in approximately 100,000 primary \(grades 3 to 5\) and upper primary \(grades 6 to 8\) students, forming what we called the Lockdown Learning Expansion \(LLX\). Throughout the 2022-23 academic year, our teaching staff provided support to these children at 857 centers, both before and after school. )
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
