/T (We volunteer to help track and bring out-of-school children to school and provide hands-on support to teachers in their teaching-learning process. This includes equipping teachers with teaching-learning materials and offering guidance in the planning of engaging activities through regular meetings. The results have been promising, as teachers exhibit a keen interest in embracing innovative classroom practices and leveraging local resources to create impactful teaching-learning materials. Empowered by their newfound knowledge and skills, these teachers have even assumed leadership roles, spearheading the training of their fellow educators.)
