/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (At ASPIRE, our vision for transforming the education landscape extends beyond the confines of classrooms. To bring about meaningful and lasting change, we actively engage with key stakeholders in local self-governance. This includes District Education Officers, Block Education Officers, Panchayati Raj institutions, gram panchayats, panchayat samitis, Zila Parishad, and others. Through these partnerships, we are able to drive change in children's education, safeguard child rights, address challenges such as child marriage and child labor, and track out-of-school children.)
/E (At ASPIRE, our vision for transforming the education landscape extends beyond the confines of classrooms. To bring about meaningful and lasting change, we actively engage with key stakeholders in local self-governance. This includes District Education Officers, Block Education Officers, Panchayati Raj institutions, gram panchayats, panchayat samitis, Zila Parishad, and others. Through these partnerships, we are able to drive change in children's education, safeguard child rights, address challenges such as child marriage and child labor, and track out-of-school children.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
