697 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The Child Rights Protection Forum, also known locally as Shishu Adhikar Suraksha Samiti \(SASS\), is a dedicated volunteer team focused on safeguarding children's welfare. Village-based CRPF committees, consisting of 10 to 20 members, collaborate to make decisions in monthly meetings. The committees, with equal representation of men and women, are formed through nominations and voting. CRPF conducts household visits, tracks child attendance and labor, and supports children's education by referring them to ASPIRE's programs. 33,984 individuals participated in 2,414 meetings, orientations, and training last year \(see Table 11\).)
/E (The Child Rights Protection Forum, also known locally as Shishu Adhikar Suraksha Samiti \(SASS\), is a dedicated volunteer team focused on safeguarding children's welfare. Village-based CRPF committees, consisting of 10 to 20 members, collaborate to make decisions in monthly meetings. The committees, with equal representation of men and women, are formed through nominations and voting. CRPF conducts household visits, tracks child attendance and labor, and supports children's education by referring them to ASPIRE's programs. 33,984 individuals participated in 2,414 meetings, orientations, and training last year \(see Table 11\).)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [2]
