/T (Youth groups play a pivotal role in effecting change within their communities. We organize meetings and orientations for adolescent girls, covering essential topics such as health, hygiene, child rights, and career counseling. Computer training, including STEM learning and digital literacy, is provided at our 62 Community Education Resource Centers \(CERCs\). The youth groups actively participate in helping us organize school-related activities and assist in organizing events and camps. 2,512 meetings, orientations, and trainings were held with youth groups last year, where 22,031 males and 12,952 females participated \(see Table 13\).)
/E (Youth groups play a pivotal role in effecting change within their communities. We organize meetings and orientations for adolescent girls, covering essential topics such as health, hygiene, child rights, and career counseling. Computer training, including STEM learning and digital literacy, is provided at our 62 Community Education Resource Centers \(CERCs\). The youth groups actively participate in helping us organize school-related activities and assist in organizing events and camps. 2,512 meetings, orientations, and trainings were held with youth groups last year, where 22,031 males and 12,952 females participated \(see Table 13\).)
