/T (Investment in adolescent development in rural areas is of utmost importance for several compelling reasons. Firstly, it empowers adolescents by equipping them with essential knowledge, skills, and confidence to navigate life's challenges, make informed decisions, and realize their full potential. Secondly, it catalyzes breaking the cycle of poverty and contributes to the overall socio-economic development of rural communities, fostering responsible and engaged citizenship.)
/E (Investment in adolescent development in rural areas is of utmost importance for several compelling reasons. Firstly, it empowers adolescents by equipping them with essential knowledge, skills, and confidence to navigate life's challenges, make informed decisions, and realize their full potential. Secondly, it catalyzes breaking the cycle of poverty and contributes to the overall socio-economic development of rural communities, fostering responsible and engaged citizenship.)
