/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Our comprehensive programs cater to the needs of both adolescent boys and girls, encompassing a diverse range of awareness initiatives on critical topics such as health, hygiene, nutrition, mental well-being, life skills, leadership, gender equality, the Indian constitution, citizenship, and more. We also conduct specialized sessions exclusively for adolescent girls, providing them with a safe and supportive environment to address pressing issues like child marriage, child labor, and the significance of education for girls. Moreover, recognizing the importance of digital literacy in today's world, we offer valuable training in software applications like CorelDraw, Excel, Tally, and others through our Community Education Resource Centers.)
/E (Our comprehensive programs cater to the needs of both adolescent boys and girls, encompassing a diverse range of awareness initiatives on critical topics such as health, hygiene, nutrition, mental well-being, life skills, leadership, gender equality, the Indian constitution, citizenship, and more. We also conduct specialized sessions exclusively for adolescent girls, providing them with a safe and supportive environment to address pressing issues like child marriage, child labor, and the significance of education for girls. Moreover, recognizing the importance of digital literacy in today's world, we offer valuable training in software applications like CorelDraw, Excel, Tally, and others through our Community Education Resource Centers.)
