744 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (However, the trials that Risa's family faced extended beyond her wilderness ordeal. Her father, wrongfully accused of a heinous crime alongside his friends, had been unjustly imprisoned for five long years. Despite her mother's valiant efforts to secure his release, their savings proved insufficient to overturn the false allegations that had shattered their lives. Left with no other option, Risa's mother resorted to working as a domestic help in neighboring households, weathering the abrupt upheaval that had befallen their family. It was during the stringent lockdown measures that the vigilant ASPIRE team discovered Risa toiling as a child laborer. Recognizing her dire circumstances, they swiftly intervened, providing her a lifeline by ushering her into the loving embrace of the RBC. Within its nurturing environment, Risa found solace and a renewed sense of purpose.)
/E (However, the trials that Risa's family faced extended beyond her wilderness ordeal. Her father, wrongfully accused of a heinous crime alongside his friends, had been unjustly imprisoned for five long years. Despite her mother's valiant efforts to secure his release, their savings proved insufficient to overturn the false allegations that had shattered their lives. Left with no other option, Risa's mother resorted to working as a domestic help in neighboring households, weathering the abrupt upheaval that had befallen their family. It was during the stringent lockdown measures that the vigilant ASPIRE team discovered Risa toiling as a child laborer. Recognizing her dire circumstances, they swiftly intervened, providing her a lifeline by ushering her into the loving embrace of the RBC. Within its nurturing environment, Risa found solace and a renewed sense of purpose.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
745 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Beyond her academic pursuits, Risa's spirit thrives in the realm of sports. She finds joy in playing volleyball and cricket, nurturing dreams that reach far beyond the confines of her present reality. Her youthful aspirations are imbued with the desire to one day experience the exhilaration of riding a bike. However, Risa's aspirations extend beyond personal ambitions. Her unwavering conviction lies in a heartfelt motivation - to become a police officer. With this noble calling, she seeks to protect innocent individuals from the clutches of unjust punishment, ensuring fairness and justice prevail in her community.)
/E (Beyond her academic pursuits, Risa's spirit thrives in the realm of sports. She finds joy in playing volleyball and cricket, nurturing dreams that reach far beyond the confines of her present reality. Her youthful aspirations are imbued with the desire to one day experience the exhilaration of riding a bike. However, Risa's aspirations extend beyond personal ambitions. Her unwavering conviction lies in a heartfelt motivation - to become a police officer. With this noble calling, she seeks to protect innocent individuals from the clutches of unjust punishment, ensuring fairness and justice prevail in her community.)
