/T (In the face of immense hardship, 12-year-old Vishnu Pradhan, a member of the Bhuiyan tribe, has shown remarkable resilience. Bereaved of his mother as an infant and losing his father to a tragic thunderstorm while in second grade, Vishnu's path seemed destined for struggle. Forced to drop out of school, he sought refuge with his paternal uncle, enduring grueling days working in the fields and subsisting on meager meals.)
/E (In the face of immense hardship, 12-year-old Vishnu Pradhan, a member of the Bhuiyan tribe, has shown remarkable resilience. Bereaved of his mother as an infant and losing his father to a tragic thunderstorm while in second grade, Vishnu's path seemed destined for struggle. Forced to drop out of school, he sought refuge with his paternal uncle, enduring grueling days working in the fields and subsisting on meager meals.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [1]
>>
