/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (However, a turning point arrived when GPCM Papuna Mahto, during a field survey visit, discovered Vishnu's plight. Convincing his elder sister to enroll him in the RBC in Telkoi block, Mahto extended a lifeline that allowed Vishnu to resume his education.)
