/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Since joining RBC in February 2022, Vishnu's life has undergone a remarkable transformation. Freed from the burdens of household chores and laborious work, he now thrives in an environment that nourishes his academic pursuits. Enjoying nourishing meals, Vishnu's spirits have been uplifted, and he has discovered a passion for cricket. Alongside his studies, he cherishes treats like biscuits, chocolates, and soan papdi. Driven by a profound sense of empathy, Vishnu harbors aspirations of becoming a doctor, aiming to bring medical care to those in need, particularly the underprivileged. His determination is further strengthened by a touching incident from his childhood, where his elder sister toiled relentlessly to gather funds for his medical treatment, epitomizing the unbreakable bond within his family.)
/E (Since joining RBC in February 2022, Vishnu's life has undergone a remarkable transformation. Freed from the burdens of household chores and laborious work, he now thrives in an environment that nourishes his academic pursuits. Enjoying nourishing meals, Vishnu's spirits have been uplifted, and he has discovered a passion for cricket. Alongside his studies, he cherishes treats like biscuits, chocolates, and soan papdi. Driven by a profound sense of empathy, Vishnu harbors aspirations of becoming a doctor, aiming to bring medical care to those in need, particularly the underprivileged. His determination is further strengthened by a touching incident from his childhood, where his elder sister toiled relentlessly to gather funds for his medical treatment, epitomizing the unbreakable bond within his family.)
