/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In the remote and challenging terrain of Odisha, Pangila Ho, a determined 25-year-old FLN volunteer, has emerged as a beacon of hope for children in her community. Despite facing numerous obstacles, her unwavering commitment to education and her community has made her a true inspiration.)
/E (In the remote and challenging terrain of Odisha, Pangila Ho, a determined 25-year-old FLN volunteer, has emerged as a beacon of hope for children in her community. Despite facing numerous obstacles, her unwavering commitment to education and her community has made her a true inspiration.)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
760 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Pangila's journey began with a fervent desire to work for the betterment of children, even though she had to discontinue her studies due to various constraints. The FLN program began with three days of rigorous training. Hailing from the Khajuribani Village, a particularly isolated region, Pangila embarked on a challenging expedition to reach the training center, located 45 kilometers away in Kumada Village, Dhakota Cluster, Anandpur Block. The arduous journey involved navigating treacherous roads and enduring poor connectivity. Undeterred by these difficulties, Pangila, accompanied by her ten-month-old daughter, embarked on a boat to cross two gram panchayats, Kolimati and Ghurikut, to attend the training. Her determination and resilience knew no bounds.)
/E (Pangila's journey began with a fervent desire to work for the betterment of children, even though she had to discontinue her studies due to various constraints. The FLN program began with three days of rigorous training. Hailing from the Khajuribani Village, a particularly isolated region, Pangila embarked on a challenging expedition to reach the training center, located 45 kilometers away in Kumada Village, Dhakota Cluster, Anandpur Block. The arduous journey involved navigating treacherous roads and enduring poor connectivity. Undeterred by these difficulties, Pangila, accompanied by her ten-month-old daughter, embarked on a boat to cross two gram panchayats, Kolimati and Ghurikut, to attend the training. Her determination and resilience knew no bounds.)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
761 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Once equipped with the necessary skills, Pangila recognized the critical need for education in her community. Conducting engaging morning sessions for 18 children from grades 1 to 5, Pangila incorporated local language songs, rhymes, and interactive activities to captivate their interest. Her efforts received recognition, not only from the children but also from her family, friends, and the entire village.)
/E (Once equipped with the necessary skills, Pangila recognized the critical need for education in her community. Conducting engaging morning sessions for 18 children from grades 1 to 5, Pangila incorporated local language songs, rhymes, and interactive activities to captivate their interest. Her efforts received recognition, not only from the children but also from her family, friends, and the entire village.)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
