/T (However, the marriage quickly unraveled, revealing a nightmarish reality. Chinmayee's father-in-law demanded dowry and harbored resentment towards her family. Her husband, a mechanical engineer, revealed his infidelity shortly after their wedding. After enduring physical abuse and a toxic environment for over three years, she finally confided in her maternal aunt, who alerted her parents. Unfortunately, their advice was to tolerate the situation.)
